modal='''<dialog id="call"><button class="close" aria-label="Close dialog">×</button><span class="kicker">LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR BUSINESS</span><h2>A clearer next move.</h2><p>Bring one challenge. We’ll discuss where the opportunity is and whether we’re the right team to help.</p><p class="draftnotice">Review preview: the booking calendar is not connected yet. This form prepares a brief; it does not send it or book a call.</p><form id="callForm"><label for="callArea">Where should we start?</label><select id="callArea"><option>Brand & Content</option><option>E-commerce</option><option>AI & Workflows</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select><label for="callChallenge">What’s getting in the way?</label><textarea id="callChallenge" rows="3" required maxlength="1200" placeholder="Tell us about the one thing you’d like to improve."></textarea><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare my call brief</button></form><div id="callOutput" hidden><p id="callText"></p><button class="button secondary" id="copyCall">Copy brief</button><p id="callStatus" role="status"></p></div></dialog>'''
